OL,3,GNEWSATrain services affected after
OL,4,Atrackside fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services travelling to London
OL,7,Fhave been affected by damage caused by
OL,8,Fa trackside fire.
OL,10,FNetwork Rail said there were delays to
OL,11,FGreat Western Railway (GWR) services,
OL,12,Fas well as a reduced service operating
OL,13,Fon the Elizabeth Line and Heathrow
OL,14,FExpress, due to fire damage to the
OL,15,Felectrical substation at Kensal Green.
OL,17,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said it
OL,18,Fhad been called to reports of a
OL,19,Ftrackside fire in the Scrubs Lane area
OL,20,Fat about 16:45 BST on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
